      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "A lovely beginning",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "They knew",
            "accent": "what they loved."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Stephanie and her partner arrived beautifully prepared. They knew what they wanted from their photoshoot and how they hoped to spend the time. It is always a pleasure to work with people who have thought about the photographs they would love to take home.",
            "The place suited them so well. The two of them, the colours, and the feeling of the morning came together, and they were clearly enjoying being there."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
