      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "The little things",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Every detail",
            "accent": "has a part to play."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "I am someone who pays a lot of attention to small things. There are more of them during a photoshoot than you might imagine: a hand, a fold of fabric, what sits behind someone’s shoulder, the way the light falls across a face.",
            "With these two, everything ran smoothly. We had time to notice those details, the photographs had beautiful colour, and the warm thank-you when I delivered them made me very happy."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
