            "accent": "Ravello."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Before we finished, we talked about another photoshoot in Ravello, either during this visit or on their next trip. I am always inviting people up there. It is one of my favourite places to photograph.",
            "I would love to continue their story among its gardens and terraces. For now, these are the photographs from a day when the people, the place, and all those little details came together."
